  "text": "Configure custom visit types and durations\n\nAdministrators and scheduling coordinators can create tailored visit categories to streamline patient intake.\n\n1. Navigate to **Settings > Scheduling > Appointment Types**.\n2. Click **New Type** in the top right corner.\n3. Enter the display name, default duration in minutes, and select a calendar color code.\n4. Check the box for **Require Intake Form** if patients must complete pre-visit paperwork.\n5. Click **Save**.\n\n### Limits and Conditions\nCustom types require a minimum duration of 5 minutes and a maximum of 480 minutes. Deactivating a type preserves historical calendar data but removes it from future booking options.\n\n### Troubleshooting\nIf a newly created visit type does not appear on the patient booking screen, check **Settings > Scheduling > Locations** to ensure the type is enabled for that specific facility. If issues persist, verify that your user role includes the `Manage Appointment Types` permission under **Settings > Staff > Roles**."
 },
